    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "HOLIDAY HOME - Harry Brann Auctioneers offer you the opportunity to acquire a 3 bedroomed mid-terrace residence located in a holiday home development within walking distance of all amenities in the popular lakeside town of Killaloe - presented to the market in excellent turn-key condition, the property is ideally suited to its current planning status of \"Short Term Holiday Lettings\" or private holiday home use."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "To include - Entrance Hall, Open-Pan Lounge/Kitchen/Dining Area, 3 Bedrooms - 2 En-suite, Family Bathroom, Shower Room, Store Room & Hot Press."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Rooms",
        "SortOrder": 2,
        "Content": "Entrance Hall - 5.68m x 1.99m \r\n+ 1.26m  x 1.07m Laminated oak timber floor. Carpeted stairs to first floor. Storage closet.\r\n\r\nBedroom 1 - 4.98m x 3.15m \r\nCarpeted. 4-door built-in wardrobes & dressing table.\r\n\r\nFamily Bathroom - 2.26m x 1.88m \r\nHalf wall & floor tiled & fully tiled around bath area. Shower off mains over bath, WC & WHB. Electric wall heater. Extractor fan.\r\n\r\nMaster Bedroom - 5.6m x 3.29m \r\nCarpeted. French door access to rear yard.\r\n\r\nWalk-in-Wardrobe - \r\nIncluded above. Fully shelved and railed.\r\n\r\nEn-Suite - \r\nIncluded Above. Walls & floor fully tiled. Shower off mains, WC & WHB. Extractor fan & electric wall heater.\r\n\r\nBedroom 3 - 3.68m x 3.31m \r\nCarpeted. 2 door built-in wardrobe & dressing table. Double French doors to rear patio & garden area.\r\n\r\nShower Room - \r\nIncluded Above. Wall & floor tiled. Electric shower, WC & WHB. Electric wall heater. Extractor fan. Recessed lighting.\r\n\r\nLanding - 3.89m x 1.15m \r\n+ 1.28m  x 0.93m Laminated oak timber floor. Fully shelved hot-press. Attic access. Recessed lighting.\r\n\r\nOpen Plan Living/Dining/Kitchen - \r\n\r\n\r\nLounge/Dining area - 5.3m x 3.71m \r\nLaminated oak timber floor. Electric fire corner unit. Double French doors with glass balcony area. TV & telephone points.\r\n\r\nKitchen - 3.18m x 2.01m \r\nCeramic tiled floor. Fully fitted country cream units to include integrated electric oven, hob, extractor & dishwasher. Mosaic over counter tiling/ Plumbed for washer/dryer. Spot lighting.\r\n\r\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Services to include - Night storage electric heating. Mains water & mains sewerage.\r\nPVC double glazed windows & hardwood front entrance door.\r\nCommunal parking. Maintenance-free rear garden with large paved patio area.\r\nActive Management Company in place. \r\nBuilt in 2006 - Ideal investment or holiday home opportunity"
      },
      {
